# This kernel implements a direct computation of ConvTranspose3d.
# Each thread computes one element in the output tensor.
# It iterates through all possible input channels and kernel elements
# to sum up contributions to its assigned output element.
# This is a naive implementation and may not outperform highly optimized
# library implementations (e.g., cuDNN) for all cases, but it demonstrates
# the replacement of the PyTorch operator with a custom CUDA kernel.
